 "EXECUTIVE SUMMARY": "",
 "Breathwork for <b>Companies</b>": "",
 "Let's Talk": "",
 "\"Regulated people think better, lead better and work better together. Everything else follows from that.\"": "",
 "When the nervous system is chronically activated, no amount of strategy, training, or motivation fixes the underlying problem.<em> Breathwork for Corporate</em> works at the level where the change actually happens.": "",
 "<b>THE MECHANISM</b> IS PHYSIOLOGICAL": "",
 "Your nervous system does not know the difference between a tiger and a Monday full of back to back calls. Breathwork gives it a way out of that state in minutes, not weeks of trying to think your way calm.": "",
 "<b>THE APPROACH</b> IS SAFE FOR EVERYONE": "",
 "No one is asked to share, perform, or explain what they’re carrying. Grounded in <em>Polyvagal Theory</em>, every session is built so a first timer and someone with years of practice both leave regulated, not exposed.": "",
 "<b>THE RESULTS</b> ARE TRANSFERABLE": "",
 "You are not learning to feel good for an hour in a room with candles. You are learning a switch you can use before a hard conversation, a pitch, or a decision that matters, on your own, with no facilitator needed.": "",
