 "HOW WE WORK TOGETHER": "",
 "How it works,<br><span>Step by step</span>": "",
 "Intro call": "",
 "A free 30-minute call to understand your team, your goals and your dates, and what your company needs right now.": "",
 "Assessment": "",
 "Everyone fills in a short, anonymous questionnaire about stress, sleep and energy, with a general health check so the practice is safe for everyone.": "",
 "Proposal": "",
 "Within 48 hours you receive my proposal, based on the results: the format I suggest, logistics and price, ready for your approval.": "",
 "Sessions": "",
 "We do the work together, in person at your venue or online.": "",
 "Follow-up": "",
 "Everyone takes home a practice to keep using on their own. I send the invoice and everything is settled.": "",
 "Choose the <b>format</b>": "",
 "SINGLE SESSION | 60-90 min": "",
 "An introduction to breathwork and nervous system regulation. Your team releases stress, learns a simple breathing reset and leaves lighter and clear-minded.": "",
 "<em><strong>Best for</strong>: offsites, kickoffs, conferences</em>": "",
 "DEEP IMMERSION | 2-3 h": "",
 "A longer session that goes deeper, with conscious connected breathing and time to integrate what comes up. This is where lasting shifts start.": "",
 "<em><strong>Best for</strong>: leadership teams, year-end gatherings</em>": "",
 "WEEKLY RESET PROGRAM | 30-45 min": "",
 "A short session every week or two that builds regulation into a team habit. Over the weeks, people feel their baseline shift toward more stability.": "",
 "<em><strong>Best for</strong>: busy seasons, onboarding, pre-launch</em>": "",
 "Not sure which one fits? We’ll choose together on the first call.": "",
 "Request a Proposal": "",
 "Corporate <b>Retreats</b>": "",
 "ONE DAY FORMAT": "",
 "A single day built for team building, designed to leave a real impact within a limited window. Sessions mix theory and practice, so your team understands the work with both body and mind. Everyone goes home the same evening with new insight into how their nervous system shapes focus, decisions, and collaboration.": "",
 "MULTI-DAY FORMAT": "",
 "For deeper, more lasting change, multi-day formats work as either a deep immersion or a <strong>workation</strong>, practices woven directly into your team’s working day.<br>Your people learn to make decisions from a place of clarity instead of stress, and I stay with you throughout, showing the most efficient way to work with the body so it supports the work rather than working against it.": "",
 "<b>What happens</b> during a corporate breathwork session?": "",
 "Every session is designed to bring the team to a clear, specific place: calmer under pressure, more resilient through a demanding stretch, sharper and more focused before a decision that matters.": "",
 "The process starts with slowing the breath and guiding attention inward, working with the body’s own signals instead of bypassing them. It often involves curated music or vibrational instruments that guide participants into a deep, receptive state, where the shift begins to happen physically, in the breath, the chest, the shoulders, and moves outward from there: a clearer head before a hard decision, more patience in a tense conversation.": "",
 "<strong>These sessions work well for:</strong>": "",
